WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.735
-My next guest is
an Emmy-nominated actor

00:00:02.735 --> 00:00:04.237
who you know from "Broad City."

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:07.941
She co-wrote and stars in
the new movie "False Positive,"

00:00:07.941 --> 00:00:10.643
which premieres June 25th
on Hulu.

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:13.012
Please welcome Ilana Glazer!

00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:14.380
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:15.748
♪ -Ilana Glazer ♪

00:00:15.748 --> 00:00:18.384
♪ Let that woman live ♪

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:19.952
♪ Nothing can faze her ♪

00:00:19.952 --> 00:00:22.455
♪ 'Cause she's false positive ♪

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:24.257
♪ Ilana Glazer ♪

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:26.493
♪ Don't call her insane ♪

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:28.427
♪ She's got some issues ♪

00:00:28.427 --> 00:00:30.796
♪ It's more than mama brain ♪

00:00:30.796 --> 00:00:33.433
♪ Yeah ♪
-Oh, my goodness, come on now.

00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:35.401
-How does one sit?

00:00:35.401 --> 00:00:37.703
-Yeah. You kind of sit -- Yes.

00:00:37.703 --> 00:00:39.705
-I don't even know
how to sit pregnant.

00:00:39.705 --> 00:00:40.807
You know what I mean?

00:00:40.807 --> 00:00:42.241
-You can do whatever
you want to do.

00:00:42.241 --> 00:00:43.943
-It's sort of that,
like, Kardashian,

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:46.045
like, end of seat thing.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.045 --> 00:00:48.147
-You always sit
and have good posture, yeah.

00:00:48.147 --> 00:00:50.750
-Yeah.
-I'm so happy. Hi, baby.

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.218
-Hi. Hi, Jimmy. Hi.

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:54.687
-Baby, you just got a standing
ovation on "The Tonight Show."

00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:58.324
Not bad, huh?
-We're on "The Tonight Show."

00:00:58.324 --> 00:01:00.059
Do you like it?

00:01:00.059 --> 00:01:01.994
-This is so exciting.
This is your first baby.

00:01:01.994 --> 00:01:04.030
How is it going?
How do you feel?

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:05.799
-I -- Okay.

00:01:05.799 --> 00:01:07.366
So, I'm feeling really good,

00:01:07.366 --> 00:01:09.735
but I feel a little guilty
about it, I guess.

00:01:09.735 --> 00:01:12.171
Just 'cause I'm just like --
People are like, "I'm so sick."

00:01:12.171 --> 00:01:14.907
I was sick for a bunch of
months, and then after that,

00:01:14.907 --> 00:01:18.144
I was like, "This is
the coolest thing ever."

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:19.245
-Yeah.

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:22.248
-I mean, it's
the coolest thing ever.

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:24.250
-I'm happy.
We're all happy you're not sick.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:25.551
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:25.551 --> 00:01:27.887
Now that I'm not puking,
I'm like, "This is really cool."

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:29.422
At the time, I was like,
"I'm torn."

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:30.956
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:01:30.956 --> 00:01:35.128
-It's so wild because the movie
that we're about to talk about

00:01:35.128 --> 00:01:37.062
is just unbelievable timing.

00:01:37.062 --> 00:01:41.601
You're pregnant, and the movie
is about getting pregnant.

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:42.869
It's bizarre.

00:01:42.869 --> 00:01:44.938
-We filmed this
like two years ago,

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:47.073
and I was very much
not pregnant, and then --

00:01:47.073 --> 00:01:48.908
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:50.510
Not even a little bit pregnant.

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:54.680
And so, also, it was like we
were going to do festivals

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:57.049
and then COVID pushed it back
and then this festival

00:01:57.049 --> 00:01:58.351
was still pushed back.

00:01:58.351 --> 00:02:00.687
We were going to bring it out
in April.

00:02:00.687 --> 00:02:03.989
And, like, now it's just
I'm just so pregnant,

00:02:03.989 --> 00:02:06.826
as I am in the movie.

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:08.628
-It's so meant to be.
-It's actually creepy.

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:11.430
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.430 --> 00:02:12.932
-No.

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:18.103
If your baby is anything like
you, what do we have to expect?

00:02:18.103 --> 00:02:22.341
-I was -- I mean, I really
loved to perform as a kid.

00:02:22.341 --> 00:02:23.476
I was like --
[ Vocalizes ]

00:02:23.476 --> 00:02:24.877
You know, me and my brother
would make

00:02:24.877 --> 00:02:27.046
all these comedy videos, but --
-Oh, really?

00:02:27.046 --> 00:02:28.982
You mean this girl
liked to perform?

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:30.816
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.816 --> 00:02:37.457
-That is 1990s Long Island dance
competition realness, okay?

00:02:37.457 --> 00:02:39.292
-That's what I'm talking about
right there.

00:02:39.292 --> 00:02:41.327
-We're talking Suffolk County.
-Yes!

00:02:41.327 --> 00:02:44.764
-We're talking paying
to get into the competition.

00:02:44.764 --> 00:02:48.167
What kind of scam is that,
you know?

00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:50.369
That is -- That is real.
-That is so cute.

00:02:50.369 --> 00:02:51.937
Oh, my gosh.
-Hilarious.

00:02:51.937 --> 00:02:53.840
-I want to talk about this

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:56.409
because this movie
is not hilarious.

00:02:56.409 --> 00:02:57.744
This is actually a thriller.

00:02:57.744 --> 00:02:59.979
-Yeah. It's really disturbing.
-Yeah.

00:02:59.979 --> 00:03:03.282
[ Laughter ]
-It's -- It's really scary.

00:03:03.282 --> 00:03:08.120
"False Positive" is
a psychological thriller about

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:12.057
how the patriarchy is
expressed through medicine,

00:03:12.057 --> 00:03:17.763
particularly pregnancy medicine,
and it's literally scary.

00:03:17.763 --> 00:03:19.097
-Yeah. How'd you come up
with that?

00:03:19.097 --> 00:03:21.000
I mean, I know all comedians
are dark, but I mean --

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.036
-Yeah.

00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:25.571
-This is a great idea,
and it's well done.

00:03:25.571 --> 00:03:27.073
I mean, everyone in this
is great.

00:03:27.073 --> 00:03:29.909
Justin Theroux is great.
Pierce Brosnan.

00:03:29.909 --> 00:03:32.879
-Is he scary or is he scary?

00:03:32.879 --> 00:03:35.781
-And the funny --
He's James Bond.

00:03:35.781 --> 00:03:38.017
He's the best-looking dude,
the nicest dude.

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:40.453
-I know. He's, like,
such a lovely human

00:03:40.453 --> 00:03:44.623
and so, so handsome that it was
like, "Is this gonna work?"

00:03:44.623 --> 00:03:47.526
It was actually scarier
how handsome he is.

00:03:47.526 --> 00:03:49.127
It was like,
"You're creepy, dude."

00:03:49.127 --> 00:03:51.263
You know what I mean?
-He did such a good job, yeah.

00:03:51.263 --> 00:03:52.698
-Ooh!
-Did you have to, like,

00:03:52.698 --> 00:03:55.234
in between takes, go like,
"Okay, I'm acting, I'm acting.

00:03:55.234 --> 00:03:56.569
I'm not really this creepy."

00:03:56.569 --> 00:04:00.306
-We like --
It was, like, so built up.

00:04:00.306 --> 00:04:03.843
You know, in comedy you get
that release where it's, like,

00:04:03.843 --> 00:04:08.180
in the scene, you're whatever,
farting, making out with Dratch,

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:10.282
you know what I mean?
And you're laughing during it.

00:04:10.282 --> 00:04:12.718
-Sure.
-Or, like, right after.

00:04:12.718 --> 00:04:15.621
But afterwards, we'd be like --
[ Whimpering ]

00:04:15.621 --> 00:04:18.658
Like, me and Pierce getting
the, like, "giggles" of --

00:04:18.658 --> 00:04:20.126
You know what I mean?
Of creepiness.

00:04:20.126 --> 00:04:22.394
It was scary.

00:04:22.394 --> 00:04:24.530
-Well, we already kind of set up
the film, basically, right?

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:26.365
-Yeah.
-So I just want to show a clip.

00:04:26.365 --> 00:04:28.801
Here's Ilana Glazer
in "False Positive."

00:04:28.801 --> 00:04:29.869
Take a look at this one.

00:04:29.869 --> 00:04:32.772
-Mummy brain is a real thing,
Lucy.

00:04:32.772 --> 00:04:37.943
Prepartum depression hits about
one out of five women.

00:04:37.943 --> 00:04:40.179
-Listen to Dr. Hindle.

00:04:40.179 --> 00:04:44.917
You should be enjoying
this process.

00:04:44.917 --> 00:04:49.021
-We now know that Xanax is safe
at .25 milligrams

00:04:49.021 --> 00:04:52.959
starting with third trimester.

00:04:52.959 --> 00:04:54.994
-So this won't affect Wendy?

00:04:54.994 --> 00:04:57.296
-Wendy?

00:04:57.296 --> 00:05:00.833
No. No, no.

00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:02.968
Try and take care of yourself,
Lucy.

00:05:02.968 --> 00:05:04.369
Hmm?

00:05:04.369 --> 00:05:08.340
Do that for me?

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:11.177
-Smile, Lucy.

00:05:11.177 --> 00:05:14.180
It actually makes you happier.

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:15.715
It's scientifically proven.

00:05:15.715 --> 00:05:16.849
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:16.849 --> 00:05:18.818
-Ilana Glazer!

00:05:18.818 --> 00:05:22.588
"False Positive" premieres
June 25th on Hulu.

00:05:22.588 --> 00:05:24.189
We're so happy that you came
into the studio, by the way.

00:05:24.189 --> 00:05:26.259
-I'm so happy to be here.
-The audience loves it.

00:05:26.259 --> 00:05:27.493
We're all so happy
that you're here.

00:05:27.493 --> 00:05:29.962
[ Cheers and applause ]
I'm so happy for you.

00:05:29.962 --> 00:05:31.230
Ilana Glazer once again.

